<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>World Airport Database — 85,545 Airports, 9,056 IATA Codes, 247 Countries</title>
<meta name="description" content="World Airport Database — the most comprehensive open airport database with 85,545 airports across 247 countries. Search 9,056 IATA codes, explore airport profiles, and use travel tools.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://world-airport-database.com/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="World Airport Database">
<meta property="og:description" content="85,545 airports across 247 countries.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://world-airport-database.com/">
